        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Imutsya omukono gwawe, ogworekye ahaiguru, orubaare rugwe omu nsi ya Misri yoona, aha bantu n'amatungo n'aha bimezire byona omu nsi ya Misri yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.38.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 38:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa yaimutsya enkoni ye, agyorekire ahaiguru; MUKAMA yaahindisa eiguru, yaagwisa orubaare, omuriro gwashuuma ahansi; MUKAMA yaagwisa atyo orubaare omu nsi ya Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haagwa orubaare, n'omuriro gwaguma nigutyankana ahagati yaarwo, orubaare rwingi munonga, orutakagwaga mu nsi ya Misri yoona okwiha obu yaaba eihanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo rubaare rwaita byona ebyabaire biri omu ishwa, abantu n'amatungo, omu nsi ya Misri yoona; kandi rwateera ebimezire byona, rwahendagura n'emiti yoona, eby'omu ishwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
