          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.12.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 12:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Faraho yaatuma kweta Musa na Arooni; ku baizire, yaabagira ati: Aha murundi ogu nsiisire; MUKAMA niwe ahikiriire, nyowe n'abantu bangye turi babi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 8:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mweshengyereze MUKAMA, ahakuba okuhinda oku okw'amaani n'orubaare nibimara; naaza kubareka mugyende, timukiguma aha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.24.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 24:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa yaamugira ati: Ku ndaarugye omu rurembo, ahonaaho niinyija kutega MUKAMA emikono, okuhinda nkwija kuhwaho, kandi n'orubaare tirurigaruka kubaho, obone kumanya ku ensi eri eya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.26.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 26:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka iwe n'abaheereza baawe, nimmanya ku murikwija kuba mutakitiina MUKAMA Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ahabw'orubaare orwo furakisi na sayiri bikafa, ahabw'okuba sayiri ekaba eri obushiisha, kandi furakisi ekaba neerabya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka engano na kusemeti tibirateirwe, ahakuba bikaba bitakamezire.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaaruga ahari Faraho omu rurembo, yaatega MUKAMA emikono; okuhinda n'orubaare byahwaho, n'enjura tiyaagaruka kugwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faraho ku yaareebire enjura n'orubaare n'okuhinda byahwaho, yaayeyongyera kushiisha, yaagangaaza omutima gwe, we n'abaheereza be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutima gwa Faraho gwagangaara, tiyaareka Baisraeli kugyenda, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa kugamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.35"
            ]
          }
        }
